{"title":"1977 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/9/4c9bb021a3f6e3d29fabf4d5d463fe9e85124b7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;u&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"76\" height=\"13\" /> and define \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/a/60abc54bcbc1505553158b221308b91482b30cb9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[u_1=1+u\\quad ,\\quad u_2=\\frac{1}{u_1}+u\\quad  \\ldots\\quad  u_{n+1}=\\frac{1}{u_n}+u\\quad ,\\quad n\\ge 1\\]\" width=\"478\" height=\"39\" />\nShow that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/4/b84170fcc260b7d7e7cc2c59742e9852beeb6878.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_n&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" /> for all values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/7/8e778ab37c9fba5d48f5c7648a7e9c4d85c86c32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=1,2,3\\ldots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"101\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Prove by induction that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/a/59a647bfb934522c6175e154c93793373250c3ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\forall i&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/c/dfc997a8ca7ee6bec978bfcccd8114311858ba8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1&lt;u_i&lt;\\frac{1}{1-u}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"121\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/4/fc428d0446d5f5f5ec52224f731881c8abd82a91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_1=1+k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"17\" /> that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/7/af79201b861d38c312fc3a76f69ffeed76dcc9fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1&lt;u_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/b/96bcb3aed22fe68811440897114c967ea8e2d53f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+u&lt;\\frac{1}{1-u} \\to 1-u^2&lt;1 \\to -u^2&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"318\" height=\"40\" />.\n</p><p>By induction if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/3/9a388da6b2f6b0e832d17fe6a0db086a13552f3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_i&lt;\\frac{1}{1-u}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"88\" height=\"40\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/e/51e2595b5e0724aa58fe867ec612e1f9b96d63b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_{i+1}=\\frac{1}{u_i}+u&gt;(1-u)+u=1 \\to u_{i+1}&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"352\" height=\"41\" /> and if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/7/7e73bf584146d0533a4a1d530be768571f886b89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_i&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"51\" height=\"17\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/2/ac2ee9805ce40514ba6233c38a23be5438e6b0b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_i&gt;1&gt;1-\\frac{u^2}{1-u+u^2}=\\frac{1-u}{1-u+u^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"302\" height=\"42\" /> (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/a/06a5f89f7b7652c8d1d52fa4e458db7694c48940.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{u^2}{1-u+u^2}&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"121\" height=\"42\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d6176ee30d1da9f09822824789423ef685ae813.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u^2&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/e/d7e53ecb2830755e168bba33c76667af37a93d5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1-u+u^2&gt;1-u&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"183\" height=\"18\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/2/0a28e4d0efa1d42f816741952579549523a82a18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1&gt;u$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" />).\n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/3/993a4f68d50346529119884a6eb351c237998f38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_{i+1}=\\frac{1}{u_i}+u$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"111\" height=\"41\" /> and so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/a/5fa9e9afd08ddec789ff16e360daf86844811650.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_{i+1}&lt;\\frac{1-u+u^2}{1-u}+u=\\frac{1}{1-u} \\to u_{i+1}&lt;\\frac{1}{1-u}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"378\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/f/1cfd14c2c8a4ec665871cfcfd72248c8ff3fa22a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1&lt;u_{i+1}&lt;\\frac{1}{1-u}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"138\" height=\"40\" />, and in particular <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/1/a110f25d0fcc041a6edfb14258116b5fadc7eead.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_{i+1}&gt;1 \\forall$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"78\" height=\"18\" />  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/6/0e6f5ccabae7a15544c550d5e72889aa4ca4ed93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i\\geq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"38\" height=\"15\" />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017172531\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.020 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 79/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4320/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:13281:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017172531 and revision id 246593. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}